{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "turn-config/a-turn-with-no-config-declares-the-binding-s-tools",
  "title": "A turn whose configuration returns none, or that has no configuration, declares the tools its binding's metadata declares, served by the agent's handler, before the agent's own, whose definition stands under its name; a null there declares none, and a binding's null setting keeps the agent's",
  "rules": [
    "§6.4",
    "Appendix A.9"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: channels/_ai_context.py _resolve_turn, _turn_settings, _turn_source, _turn_base_tools; channels/_turn_config.py AIChannelTurnConfig. tests/test_channels/test_turn_config.py TestConfigProvider::test_provider_returning_none_keeps_static_path, test_no_provider_is_byte_identical_to_static_path, TestANullDefers::test_a_null_tools_declares_no_toolset, test_a_binding_null_keeps_the_channel_default (system_prompt, temperature, max_tokens, reasoning_effort). The configuration returns none for room-1 and names no other room. In room-4 the binding declares a tool under the agent's own tool's name: the agent's stands, at its place, with its definition. In room-5 an agent with no configuration reads its binding's tools.",
